# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily News Digest — .gitignore
#
# This repo ships the ENGINE and TEMPLATES only. Everything below is
# either machine-generated, runtime state, or personal to one user and
# is intentionally kept OUT of version control. The files still live on
# disk locally so your own digest keeps running — they're just untracked.
#
# A new user runs the "setup-news-digest" skill (or copies the *.example
# files by hand) to generate their own personal copies of the ignored
# files below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Generated output: daily digests & run logs ---
*-news-digest.html
*-run-log.md
*-run-log-TEST.md
*-news-digest-TEST.html

# --- Personal config & state (created from the *.example templates) ---
_pipeline/config.json
news_feedback.md
daily-topics.md
story-history.json

# --- Runtime state & locks ---
_pipeline/state/
_pipeline/.run.lock
*.lock

# --- Python bytecode ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# --- Local SKILL working copies & backups (repo ships canonical SKILL.md) ---
SKILL.fixed.md
_pipeline/SKILL.v1-monolith-backup.md
_pipeline/SKILL.v2-prebuild-backup.md

# --- Development scratch / one-off artifacts ---
REWRITE-review-hardened.md
*-before-after.html
*-negotiations-digest.html

# --- Personal dev notes (not part of the shipped engine) ---
cowork_portability_best_practices.md
RESEARCH-figures-in-digest.md
linkedin-posts-drafts.md

# --- Personal history archives (rolled-off story history; never publish) ---
story-history-archive-*.json

# --- Local regression fixtures (stories.json + expected HTML pairs; machine-local) ---
_goldens/

# --- Scratch temp files ---
*.tmp
_deltest.tmp

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
